{"about_the_game":"Immerse yourself in the world of Kamikaze Lassplanes with its electrifying official soundtrack! Featuring a mesmerizing blend of high-energy beats, atmospheric synths, and emotionally charged melodies, this OST captures every moment of action, mystery, and heartfelt storytelling from the game.<br><br>\ud83c\udfb5 Track Highlights:<br>\ud83d\udd25 Intense shoot-'em-up themes that fuel the adrenaline rush<br>\ud83c\udf19 Dreamy, melancholic tracks that set the tone for deep narrative moments<br>\ud83c\udfb6 A fusion of electronic, orchestral, and retro-inspired sounds<br><br>Whether you're dodging enemy fire or getting lost in the game's visual novel drama, these tracks bring Kamikaze Lassplanes to life\u2014anytime, anywhere.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Kamikaze Lassplanes:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/5cd1b3716cce7344743f6168e537bf45.poster.avif?t=1773845004\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/5cd1b3716cce7344743f6168e537bf45.webm?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/5cd1b3716cce7344743f6168e537bf45.mp4?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/f9b818408bc025a3fc0136d1fbadb686.poster.avif?t=1773845004\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/f9b818408bc025a3fc0136d1fbadb686.webm?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/f9b818408bc025a3fc0136d1fbadb686.mp4?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Kamikaze Lassplanes is a brand new mix of Visual Novel and SHMUP with crucial story-branching decisions that lead to different gameplay and story outcomes, both for war, romance, and the protagonists\u2019 fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/b419c9c2d89c16d34e00759d7f48b580.poster.avif?t=1773845004\" width=616 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/b419c9c2d89c16d34e00759d7f48b580.webm?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Meet and fall for <strong>Alba Tross\u00e9</strong> and <strong>Hannah Brandenburg</strong> - charismatic Lassplanes who transform into deadly war planes you pilot. Face the Imperial fleet together in challenging arcade shoot-'em-up encounters and discover the secret behind their mysterious origin.<br><br><strong>But will the gift prove to be a curse?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/3b056bfaf504c3e7615b584ef219c886.poster.avif?t=1773845004\" width=616 height=113 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/3b056bfaf504c3e7615b584ef219c886.webm?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into an engaging, dark story about exploring humanity in a world where every rose has its thorn, and every tool can become a weapon. When nothing is as it seems, your beliefs are shattered as you uncover the truth\u2014and perhaps you\u2019ll pay the ultimate price for it.<br><br><strong>Decide the fate of your kingdom and your heart.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/b7b3a13534a6a0dcb373c50dc6f758ed.poster.avif?t=1773845004\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/b7b3a13534a6a0dcb373c50dc6f758ed.webm?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/b7b3a13534a6a0dcb373c50dc6f758ed.mp4?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/76af8bc06ed2f88462d91710190096a6.poster.avif?t=1773845004\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/76af8bc06ed2f88462d91710190096a6.webm?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/76af8bc06ed2f88462d91710190096a6.mp4?t=1773845004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394390/extras/5690972f20df08c45154ea73b2054ce9.avif?t=1773845004\" width=616 height=113 /></span><br><br><strong>Your choices matter:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock various endings that will reveal different faces of Alba and Hannah. <br></li><li>Discover and collect a gallery of beautiful, hand-drawn ecchi illustrations. <br></li><li>Challenge yourself in Arcade mode and beat records. <br></li><li>Control the lethal Lassplanes in various missions set in a fully 3D environment.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394390?t=1773845004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic